  "title": "Apple Dapple Cake",
  "description": "This apple dapple cake recipe is moist from apples, chewy from coconut, and crunchy from walnuts. The buttery-sweet glaze adds yet another dimension.",
  "authors": [
    "irenedee"
  ],
